              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            },
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-203-4-003",
              "target_id": "147",
              "target_type": "section",
              "anchor_text": "section 147",
              "relationship": "subject_to",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "5",
          "id": "203-5",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 13,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "The provisions of this section shall not apply unless the option is exercised by the person in the prescribed manner on or before the due date specified under section 263(1) for furnishing the return of income and such option once exercised shall apply to subsequent tax years. (6) Once the option under this section has been exercised for any tax year, it shall not be subsequently withdrawn for the same or any other tax year. 26",
          "children": [],
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-203-5-001",
              "target_id": "263-1",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "section 263(1)",
              "relationship": "depends_on",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "7",
          "id": "203-7",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 15,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "In case of an assessee, being a co-operative society, which has exercised option under sub-section (5), the requirements contained in sub-section (1) shall be modified to the extent that the deduction under section 149(2)(d)(ii) shall be available to such assessee as does not exceed the amount of dividend distributed by it to its members at least one month before the due date for filing the return of income under section 263(1).]",
